          "id": 443965242,
          "type": null,
          "body": "@AndersBroman thanks, but ANSI and GSM are different menu items. During my investigation I found out they went side by side together. Also, I found, that ANSI might mean IS-41 aka ANSI-41 standard in Wireshark context. Tell me if I'm wrong please. I will add fresh info to the docs.",
